@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About - Quest Board</PageTitle>

<div class="container py-4 quest-log-page">
    <h1>About Quest Board</h1>

    <p class="text-muted mb-4">
        Your personal log of adventures, objectives, and rewards.
    </p>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h4 class="card-title">What is Quest Board?</h4>

            <p class="card-text">
                Quest Board is a fantasy-themed application for creating,
                organizing, and tracking quests.
            </p>

            <p class="card-text">
                Each quest can have its own difficulty, reward, status,
                and list of objectives. Track your progress as you work
                through available adventures.
            </p>

            <h4 class="card-title mt-4">Built with</h4>

            <ul>
                <li>C# and ASP.NET Core</li>
                <li>Blazor for interactive web components</li>
                <li>Bootstrap and custom fantasy-inspired styling</li>
                <li>JSON file storage for saving quests</li>
            </ul>

            <h4 class="card-title mt-4">Source Code</h4>

            <p class="card-text">
                Explore the source code, follow development, or contribute on GitHub.
            </p>

            <a href="https://github.com/Brage1025/QuestBoard" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
               class="btn btn-primary">
                View on GitHub
            </a>

            <a href="https://github.com/Brage1025/QuestBoard/blob/main/LICENSE" target="_blank"
               rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary ms-2">
                License
            </a>

            <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                A small full-stack learning project inspired by fantasy
                RPG quest logs.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
```
